ok   the primitive numbers: c = 8/15, R_ud = 17/37, a = 5/38, chi_A = 13/12, eta = 295/296, sigma = 75/74, c_L = 15/74, E_H = 3, f = 9/250, nu = 9/4000

======================================================================================================================
THE COMPLETIONS: each computed from the law, then what is seen, then the name
======================================================================================================================
5. a distinction of type 2|4: the null cone has signature (1, 3) (Part I) and the rotation of the divided plane commutes
   with every rotation within the two sides: seen, three plus one and the light cone; named, time, space, the common clock.
ok   6. the long-wave limit: at u = 1/4 - eps^2 m^2/24 the law's operator is (eps^2/8)(m^2 - Delta): Klein-Gordon; named mass, length, light
ok   7. the first-order step: U + U^dagger = 2 cos k cos mu, cos w = cos mu cos k: Dirac; at rest the phase is a clock, E = mc^2

